{
  "title": "Juicy Dense Tunisian Chicken Tagine",
  "description": "A buttery and dense Tunisian dish featuring szechuan peppercorns, this kid-friendly recipe is perfect for a weeknight dinner. It is also diabetic-friendly due to the use of low-carb ingredients.",
  "cuisine": "Tunisian",
  "diet": [
